[00:00.00] 作词 : Nick Mason/Richard Wright/David Gilmour/Roger Waters
[00:00.00] 作曲 : Nick Mason/Richard Wright/David Gilmour/Roger Waters
[02:27.49]Ticking away the moments that make up a dull day,
[02:27.49]分秒滴答消磨沉闷时光
[02:34.93]You fritter and waste the hours in an offhand way,
[02:34.93]你漫不经心地挥霍着时光
[02:42.32]Kicking around on a piece of ground in your home town,
[02:42.32]在家乡的角落徘徊游荡
[02:49.62]Waiting for someone or something to show you the way,
[02:49.62]等待某人某物指明方向
[02:56.53]Tired of lying in the sunshine staying home to watch the rain,
[02:56.53]厌倦了晒着太阳听雨声
[03:04.32]You are young and life is long and there is time to kill today,
[03:04.32]年少岁月长 今日正可虚度光阴
[03:12.29]And then one day you find ten years have got behind you,
[03:12.29]忽觉十年岁月已悄然流逝
[03:19.29]No one told you when to run, you missed the starting gun,
[03:19.29]没人提醒你起跑的枪声
[04:53.21]And you run and you run to catch up with the sun, but it's sinking,
[04:53.21]你狂奔追赶落日却见它沉沦
[05:01.04]And racing around to come up behind you again,
[05:01.04]它又绕到身后开始新旅程
[05:07.97]The sun is the same in the relative way, but you're older,
[05:07.97]太阳依旧你却添了年轮
[05:15.13]Shorter of breath and one day closer to death,
[05:15.13]呼吸渐短 离死亡又近一分
[05:22.22]Every year is getting shorter, never seem to find the time,
[05:22.22]年岁愈觉短促 总寻不得空闲
[05:29.78]Plans that either come to naught or half a page of scribbled lines,
[05:29.78]计划终成泡影或半页涂鸦
[05:37.14]Hanging on in quiet desperation is the English way,
[05:37.14]沉默的绝望是英伦做派
[05:44.58]The time is gone the song is over, thought I'd something more to say,
[05:44.58]曲终时逝 犹觉未尽抒怀
[06:09.31]Home, home again,
[06:09.31]归家 重返家园
[06:16.88]I like to be here when I can,
[06:16.88]闲暇时我愿在此流连
[06:24.78]And when I come home cold and tired,
[06:24.78]当我寒冷疲惫返家之时
[06:31.93]It's good to warm my bones beside the fire,
[06:31.93]炉火暖身最是惬意
[06:39.74]Far away across the field,
[06:39.74]远处田野彼端
[06:43.76]The tolling of the iron bell,
[06:43.76]铁钟沉沉敲响
[06:47.81]Calls the faithful to their knees,
[06:47.81]召唤信徒屈膝跪拜
[06:52.08]To hear the softly spoken magic spells.
[06:52.08]聆听轻柔吟诵的魔咒真言
